  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of Eswatini Big5 Nature Reserve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to integrate existing private and state nature reserves, cattle farms, and portions of land from three different communities under a single protected area and governance framework to expand habitat and landscapes connectivity for key terrestrial wildlife populations (lions, elephants, rhinos, giraffe); strengthen human-wildlife co-existence and increase flow of economic benefits to communities, especially women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
